---
title: Checkout
---
sequenceDiagram
  %% Every construct the reader takes, once.
  autonumber 3
  box Aqua Storefront
    actor U as Shopper
    participant W as Web<br>app
  end
  participant API@{ "type" : "boundary" }
  participant DB@{ "type" : "database" }
  participant Q@{ "type" : "queue" } as Events
  U->>+W: Place order
  W->>API: POST /orders
  activate API
  API-)Q: order.created
  alt card accepted
    API->>DB: insert
    DB-->>API: ok
  else declined
    API--xW: 402
  end
  loop every 5s
    W->>W: poll status
  end
  par to shopper
    W-->>U: confirmation
  and to warehouse
    API-)Q: ship
  end
  critical charge
    API->>DB: settle
  option timeout
    API->>API: retry
  end
  opt gift wrap
    Note right of W: wrap it
  end
  break out of stock
    API-->>W: 409
  end
  rect rgb(200, 220, 255)
    Note over API,DB: inside a colored region
  end
  create participant L as Ledger
  API->>L: open account
  destroy L
  API-xL: close account
  deactivate API
  W-->>-U: done
  U<<->>W: chat
  U<<-->>W: chat again
  W->U: plain
  W-->U: plain dashed
  Note left of U: two<br>lines
